{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Sit yourself down. What has you in?",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Tired.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (DOCTOR): How long?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Months. Umm. I feel like a wet rag. I've overdone it.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (DOCTOR): Breathless on the stairs?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (DOCTOR): Chest pain?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): Craving the ice still?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): Uh. Constant. Crunching it all day.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (DOCTOR): Periods heavy?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Normal.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (DOCTOR): Bowels alright?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Grand.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): Your feet?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Dead. My feet feel dead.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): And the throat?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): A frog in my throat.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): Err, family, any diabetes or pressure?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): My father had diabetes in his fifties, mother did not, another sister has pressure but no sugar.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (DOCTOR): Work, hours, food, exercise, drink?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): I teach junior infants, thirty-five hours a week, and I can't hear myself think in that classroom. Strict vegetarian, I walk the dog most evenings, I don't drink.",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any tablets?",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): Crocin sometimes. Stopped the brown iron tablets, the ferous sulphate.",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (DOCTOR): How many Crocin?",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): Two tablets, now and again.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (DOCTOR): The iron, how long?",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): A week.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (DOCTOR): Right. Pulse is 98, blood pressure 110 over 70. You're pale in the face, no swelling at the ankles.",
  "[SEG0030] person_1 (DOCTOR): Likely low iron, not nailed down yet. I'll book a full blood count, ferritin, B12 and folate.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (DOCTOR): Eat more lentils and greens, orange juice with them. Let's see you in two weeks. We might do a chest x-ray if the breathlessness does not settle."
 ],
